# ⚠ `build_id.v` WAS IGNORED HERE UNTIL WAVE 12 (2026-09-12) AND THE ENTRY IS
# DELIBERATELY GONE.  It was a %y%m%d date stamp generated by the MiSTer
# PRE_FLOW script into CONF_STR, and WAVE 11 measured it at 1.647 ns / 1.34 MHz
# at ONE fitter seed -- larger than the seed dimension itself.  Nothing generates
# it now; if a re-vendored hdl/sys/ brings the generator back, the file must be
# VISIBLE to `git status` rather than silently ignored.  That invisibility is
# half of why it hid for the whole campaign.  quartus_gate bar E11 refuses the
# build; this line's absence is what makes the file show up at all.
# Quartus COMPILE TRANSCRIPTS.  They are hashed into each receipt's `reports`
# manifest, so a receipt already names the bytes it read -- but they run to
# ~1.3 MB per sweep and the durable artifacts (per-seed receipts, .sta.summary,
# the truefmax tables, distribution.json) live in sw/testdata/g6dist/.
